# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) to enable the /api/match-explain endpoint
# locally. The Cloudflare adapter reads .dev.vars in `npm run dev`.
#
# Set EITHER an Anthropic key (direct) OR an OpenRouter key (proxy).
# If both are set, Anthropic direct takes precedence.

# Option A — Anthropic direct
#   https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Option B — OpenRouter (uses anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5)
#   https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Admin notifier — /api/match-event pings this webhook when a visitor
# completes the /match wizard. Leave unset to disable (silent no-op).
# Works with ntfy.sh (recommended — zero signup), Discord or Slack.
#   ntfy:    https://ntfy.sh/<pick-a-private-topic-name>
#   Discord: Server Settings → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook
#   Slack:   https://api.slack.com/messaging/webhooks
# In production set it as a secret: wrangler secret put ADMIN_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK
ADMIN_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK=
